#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:161
msgid "Return to your board and confirm that your Trello data is now displaying."
msgstr "보드로 돌아가 Trello 데이터가 표시되는지 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:166
msgid ""
"Currently, the script imports all cards from a single board, including "
"their list (column) membership, names, and descriptions."
msgstr ""
"현재 이 스크립트는 단일 보드의 모든 카드를 리스트(열) 소속, 이름, 설명과 함께 "
"가져옵니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:169
msgid "Import from Todoist"
msgstr "Todoist에서 가져오기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:171
msgid ""
"This node app converts a Todoist ``.json`` archive into a "
"``.boardarchive`` file."
msgstr ""
"이 노드 앱은 Todoist ``.json`` 아카이브를 ``.boardarchive`` 파일로 "
"변환합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:173
msgid ""
"Visit the open source Todoist data export service at https://darekkay.com"
"/todoist-export/."
msgstr ""
"오픈소스 Todoist 데이터 내보내기 서비스 https://darekkay.com/todoist-"
"export/\\ 를 방문합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:174
msgid "From the **Options** menu, select **Export As > JSON (all data)**."
msgstr "**Options** 메뉴에서 **Export As > JSON (all data)**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:175
msgid "Uncheck the **Archived** option if checked."
msgstr "**Archived** 옵션이 체크되어 있으면 체크를 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:176
msgid ""
"Select **Authorize and Backup**. This will take you to your Todoist "
"account. Follow the instructions on screen."
msgstr ""
"**Authorize and Backup**\\ 를 선택합니다. 그러면 Todoist 계정으로 이동합니다. "
"화면의 안내를 따릅니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:177
msgid "Note the name and location of the downloaded ``.json`` file."
msgstr "다운로드된 ``.json`` 파일의 이름과 위치를 기록해 둡니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:186
msgid "Change directory to ``focalboard/import/todoist``."
msgstr "``focalboard/import/todoist``\\ 로 디렉토리를 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:188
msgid ""
"From within the same folder, run ``npx ts-node importTodoist.ts -i <path-"
"to-todoist.json> -o archive.boardarchive``."
msgstr ""
"같은 폴더 안에서 ``npx ts-node importTodoist.ts -i <path-to-todoist.json> -o "
"archive.boardarchive``\\ 를 실행합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/project-management/migrate-to-boards.rst:192
msgid "Return to your board and confirm that your Todoist data is now displaying."
msgstr "보드로 돌아가 Todoist 데이터가 표시되는지 확인합니다."

